1
00:00:20,816 --> 00:00:22,656
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:43,472
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:46,624
=Episode 24=

4
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:50,560
What are you trying to do?

5
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:53,240
(For Rent)

6
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:54,640
When we were together,

7
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,240
didn't you say you wanted
to see my home?

8
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:01,399
This is my home.

9
00:01:06,599 --> 00:01:08,359
Let me make your wish come true.

10
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:12,879
Didn't you say

11
00:01:16,319 --> 00:01:18,040
you'd only love me after you died?

12
00:01:20,879 --> 00:01:22,000
Stop, Zhang Haotian!

13
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:26,000
Money couldn't buy Jiang Lai's kidney.

14
00:01:26,879 --> 00:01:29,040
So you manipulated her with love.

15
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:32,159
Back then, you made me believe
Zhao Ke was seducing you.

16
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:35,000
You wanted me to get rid of her for you.

17
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,120
Because you were afraid she
was Jiang Lai.

18
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,680
You were afraid your scheme
would be exposed!

19
00:01:39,239 --> 00:01:40,040
Are you done?

20
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:40,879
No!

21
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:43,760
You used to be by my side every day,

22
00:01:43,959 --> 00:01:46,319
but suddenly, you started traveling
to North America all the time.

23
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:48,920
I looked into it.

24
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:51,319
You have no work records
in North America.

25
00:01:52,799 --> 00:01:53,680
Zhang Haotian,

26
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:56,400
I truly loved you.

27
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,560
I really didn't want to believe

28
00:01:59,599 --> 00:02:02,040
that you've been lying to me all along.

29
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:04,680
But

30
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:07,319
I can't keep fooling myself anymore.

31
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,680
So,

32
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:11,800
I let you see

33
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:14,120
the trust fund my mother left me.

34
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:17,960
Zhang Haotian, who desperately
wanted a divorce,

35
00:02:19,039 --> 00:02:20,560
changed completely after seeing
the trust fund.

36
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,599
You started loving me again.

37
00:02:25,199 --> 00:02:27,960
You shattered my last hope in you.

38
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:33,000
Zhang Haotian, from beginning to end,

39
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,800
the only thing you loved

40
00:02:35,919 --> 00:02:37,639
was my money!

41
00:02:38,319 --> 00:02:38,879
Get out!

42
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:40,879
Haotian.

43
00:02:41,439 --> 00:02:42,439
Stop this.

44
00:02:43,879 --> 00:02:44,520
Don't come closer!

45
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:48,879
Run. He's lost his mind.

46
00:02:48,879 --> 00:02:49,599
Run!

47
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:50,719
Haotian.

48
00:02:51,319 --> 00:02:51,759
No.

49
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,680
Run.

50
00:02:53,719 --> 00:02:54,520
Zhang Haotian.

51
00:02:55,199 --> 00:02:56,719
I just wanted to live a normal life.

52
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,879
To have enough food and warm clothes.

53
00:02:58,919 --> 00:02:59,680
Was I wrong?

54
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:00,319
What did I do wrong?

55
00:03:00,319 --> 00:03:01,680
Tell me!

56
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,759
What did I do wrong?

57
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:04,039
Tell me!

58
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,000
Tell me!

59
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:05,960
Say it!

60
00:03:09,159 --> 00:03:11,159
Didn't you say
you'd only love me if you died?

61
00:03:12,159 --> 00:03:13,039
I don't mind.

62
00:03:13,719 --> 00:03:15,039
I can make it happen for you.

63
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:18,159
Then we'll get married
and have our wedding.

64
00:03:18,919 --> 00:03:20,080
Just you and me.

65
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,039
I can accept that.

66
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:27,680
Ke.

67
00:03:37,319 --> 00:03:38,159
Ke.

68
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:41,960
This time,

69
00:03:43,159 --> 00:03:44,400
you finally love me.

70
00:03:45,199 --> 00:03:47,000
I can finally have you.

71
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,960
You finally love me.

72
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:55,719
(Police)

73
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:56,560
(Police)
Move! Hurry!

74
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:57,639
Zhang Haotian!

75
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:00,840
Let Jiang Lai go!

76
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,240
Who is Jiang Lai?

77
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:04,759
You have the wrong person.

78
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:06,960
She's my wife.

79
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,159
Her name is Zhao Ke.

80
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,439
She's Jiang Lai.

81
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:13,599
You and Chen Ping tricked Jiang Lai
into giving up her kidney.

82
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:15,080
And you committed financial fraud.

83
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,120
I've already handed the evidence

84
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,000
over to the police.

85
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:18,279
You...

86
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,160
Stop this now!

87
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,319
Don't hurt anyone else!

88
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,199
Zhang Haotian.

89
00:04:27,519 --> 00:04:29,319
Your accomplice Chen Ping has already
been arrested at the airport.

90
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,079
(For Rent)
There's no point resisting anymore.

91
00:04:31,199 --> 00:04:31,800
Let her go!

92
00:04:36,879 --> 00:04:38,120
I wanted you to love me.

93
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,160
I wanted you dead.

94
00:04:41,319 --> 00:04:42,480
So I have to do it myself.

95
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,879
Whether you do it or not,

96
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,360
it's already over.

97
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,480
Don't you understand?

98
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,920
Don't you all know?

99
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:50,279
That scumbag Wang treated me like a dog!

100
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,079
I've been bullied my whole life.

101
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:53,759
I've been humiliated again and again.

102
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:55,480
But even if I die,

103
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,839
I'll die with dignity.

104
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:00,959
Ke.

105
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:07,800
I can decide my own fate.

106
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,040
And I can still...

107
00:05:18,399 --> 00:05:19,639
And I can still make sure...

108
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:23,360
you remember me forever.

109
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:33,360
Haotian! Haotian!

110
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,319
Jiang Lai, are you okay?

111
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:36,759
Haotian! Haotian!

112
00:05:36,759 --> 00:05:38,000
Haotian, wake up!

113
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,920
Haotian! Haotian!

114
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,879
No! Haotian!

115
00:05:43,279 --> 00:05:44,720
Haotian!

116
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:49,160
Haotian! Haotian!

117
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:01,680
(A lost path leads to ruin.
A path of light leads afar.)

118
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,519
(Defendants Zhang Haotian
and Chen Ping,)

119
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:14,720
(after a public trial,
the court has found that)

120
00:06:14,879 --> 00:06:16,839
(you exploited people's kindness
and trust)

121
00:06:16,839 --> 00:06:18,480
(to carry out a series
of serious fraud schemes.)

122
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:21,000
(You have severely violated citizens'
personal and property rights,)

123
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:23,199
(and undermined public order, morality,
and the foundation of trust.)

124
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:25,360
(The overwhelming evidence leaves
your crimes undeniable.)

125
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,040
(The law,)

126
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:28,439
(as the final safeguard of fairness
and justice,)

127
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:30,560
(will not allow anyone
to trample upon it.)

128
00:06:31,279 --> 00:06:32,279
(Defendant Chen Ping)

129
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:34,480
(is convicted of illegal organ
trafficking and intentional homicide.)

130
00:06:35,079 --> 00:06:37,279
(You are sentenced
to twenty years in prison.)

131
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,360
(Jiang Lai)

132
00:07:03,839 --> 00:07:06,600
(I believe the championship
will definitely be yours.)

133
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:39,744
(The End)

134
00:07:40,700 --> 00:07:41,680
(Thank you for staying with us
on this journey.)

135
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,706
(May every viewer find)

136
00:07:42,706 --> 00:07:43,693
(the love and care they deserve
in life,)

137
00:07:43,693 --> 00:07:44,680
(and be surrounded by warmth
and kindness.)

138
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:50,298
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

139
00:07:50,584 --> 00:07:53,998
♪I should forget you♪

140
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:58,928
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

141
00:07:59,008 --> 00:08:01,072
♪To carry on♪

142
00:08:01,128 --> 00:08:06,560
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

143
00:08:06,624 --> 00:08:09,038
♪You no longer have the strength♪

144
00:08:10,552 --> 00:08:13,568
♪You want me to go there for you♪

145
00:08:15,064 --> 00:08:20,528
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

146
00:08:21,144 --> 00:08:24,528
♪Your freedom♪

147
00:08:24,584 --> 00:08:29,598
♪Has become my cage♪

148
00:08:30,152 --> 00:08:37,118
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

149
00:08:37,304 --> 00:08:42,668
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

150
00:08:43,464 --> 00:08:49,548
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

151
00:08:49,768 --> 00:08:54,520
♪You told me♪

152
00:08:54,568 --> 00:08:58,818
♪I would shine like a star♪

153
00:08:58,904 --> 00:09:02,600
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

154
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:06,978
♪How to live without you♪

155
00:09:07,438 --> 00:09:13,184
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

156
00:09:14,592 --> 00:09:17,688
♪So hazy and blurred♪
